{"sourceUrl":"http://edu.ipe.ac.cn/zsxx/202605/t20260512_837368.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:45.202613+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://edu.ipe.ac.cn/zsxx/202605/t20260512_837368.html","html":"<td>\n<div><p><span><span>一、活动主旨</span></span></p><p><span><span>为激发大学生对科研工作的兴趣与热情，加深其对科研工作的认识，进而吸引更多优秀学子到国科大深造，中国科学院过程工程研究所将于</span><span>7</span><span>月举办“</span><span>2026</span><span>年‘化学与化工’优秀大学生暑期学校”，并于</span><span>8</span><span>月组织“</span><span>2026</span><span>年‘化学与化工’优秀大学生夏令营”。两期活动各招收</span></span><span><span>学</span><span>/</span></span><span><span>营员约</span><span>150</span><span>人，均采取线下方式举行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、时间安排</span></span></p><p><span>暑期学校</span><span>活动</span><span><span>时间：</span>7<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span>-7<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日；</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名时间：</span><span>5</span><span>月</span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span>-6<span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日；</span></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营</span></span><span>活动预计</span><span><span>时间：</span>8<span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span>-8<span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>报名时间另行通知。</span></p><p><span><span>（如有调整请以我所网站通知时间为准。）</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、报名步骤</span></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span>首先登陆中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人行动计划平台（网址：</span><a href=\"https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/</span></span></span></a><span><span>），选择</span><span>“大学生暑期学校报名”模块，进入后选择“过程工程研究所”—“中国科学院大学‘化学与化工’优秀大学生</span></span><span>暑期学校</span><span>”进行注册报名；</span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>打开或扫描下方链接</span><span>/</span><span>二维码，填写在线问卷。</span></span></p><p><span><span>入营问卷</span></span><span>链接</span><span><span>：</span></span><a href=\"https://v.wjx.cn/vm/Y5Eh8DX.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/Y5Eh8DX.aspx</span></span></span></a><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>二维码：</span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/9cfd7a2cb4f0b3e23abd.jpg\"/><span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>提交入营申请电子</span></span><span>版</span><span><span>材料至研招办邮箱</span>yzb@ipe.ac.cn<span>，邮件主题和文件名称均为</span><span>“</span><span>学生姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>学校全称</span>-<span>学院全称</span><span>-</span><span>专业全称</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料必须按顺序整理到</span></span><strong><span><span>一个</span>PDF<span>格式文件</span></span></strong><span><span>中，文件大小不超过</span>20M<span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>入营申请电子</span></span><span>版</span><span><span>材料列表：</span></span></p><p><span>①</span><span><span>中国科学院大学</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年大学生暑期</span></span><span>学校</span><span><span>申请表（报名系统生成</span></span><span>文件</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span>②</span><span><span>本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></span></p><p><span>③</span><span><span>英语水平证明复印件（如四</span>/<span>六级）；</span></span></p><p><span>④</span><span><span>其他证明材料（如推荐信、已发表论文首页的复印件、奖状复印件、各类证书复印件等）。此项为辅助材料，为非必交材料，自愿提交。</span></span></p><p><span>注：网报期间不需要邮寄任何纸质材料。</span></p><p><span><span>四、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span><span>专业要求：化工、材料、</span></span><span>环境、</span><span><span>化学、冶金、食品、生工、资源等化工相关专业（同时欢迎双碳、新能源、智能化工领域的同学），全日制普通高等学校本科</span>202</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>级在校学生（大三，拟</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年毕业）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>满足专业要求同时达到以下任一条件即可申请：</span></span></p><p><span>①</span><span><span>专业排名满足条件：一流大学或原</span></span><span><span>985</span><span>高校</span></span><span><span>专业前</span>30%<span>、化工一流学科建设高校或原</span><span>211</span><span>高校专业前</span><span>15%</span><span>、其他高校专业前</span><span>5%</span></span><span>且有推免资格</span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>②</span><span><span>由两名过程工程研究所教育委员会或学位委员会成员推荐。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、所内生活</span></span></p><p><span>1. <span>学业奖学金：我所研究生在学期间全部享有学业奖学金，硕士学业奖学金为</span><span>8000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年，直博生学业奖学金为</span><span>13000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年。</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>生活补助：我所研究生在学期间由课题组根据学习情况发放生活补助，正常情况下不低于</span></span><span><span>2733</span></span><span><span>元</span>/<span>月（硕士</span></span><span>生</span><span><span>一年级</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>305</span></span><span>0<span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（硕士生高年级）、</span></span><span><span>3150</span></span><span><span>元</span>/<span>月</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>直博生一年级</span></span><span><span>）、</span><span>4380</span></span><span><span>元</span>/<span>月（普通博士和直博生高年级），每年夏季研究所会为学生发放</span><span>400</span><span>元高温补贴。</span></span></p><p><span>3. <span>国家助学金：我所研究生在正常学习年限内全部享有国家助学金，硕士为</span><span>500</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（即</span><span>6000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年），博士为</span><span>1250</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月（即</span><span>15000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年）。</span></span></p><p><span>4. <span>竞争性奖学金：国家奖学金（</span><span>20000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>硕士，</span><span>30000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>博士）、中国科学院院长特别奖学金（</span><span>10000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、中国科学院院长优秀奖学金（</span><span>5000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、过程所所长特别奖学金（</span><span>10000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、过程所所长优秀奖学金（</span><span>5000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、地奥奖学金（</span><span>1000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、中科环保奖（</span><span>1000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）、张懿院士奖学金（</span><span>3000-6000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>人）等一系列竞争性奖学金。</span></span></p><p><span>六、学员选拔</span></p><p><span>学员筛选由教育处组织所内专家统筹选拔，并于</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月初公布入围名单。</span></p><p><span>为便于师生提前互相了解，建议同学们主动联系感兴趣的导师。</span></p><p><span>七、活动费用</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span> <span>本次暑期学校不收取任何费用；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span> <span>我所为每</span></span><span>位学员</span><span>提供活动期间用餐；</span></p><p><span>3.</span> <span>学</span><span><span>员的住宿及交通费用自理。（注：获得过程工程研究所</span><span>“优</span></span><span>秀学员</span><span><span>”资格并于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>9-</span></span><span><span>10</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>通过</span><span>“中国研究生招生信息网”</span></span><span>正式</span><span>录取为</span><span>我所</span><span>推免</span><span>研究生的</span><span>学</span><span>员，可报销</span><span>本次暑期学校期间产生</span><span><span>的部分住宿及往返交通费用。住宿报销上限为</span><span>250</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>天</span></span><span>·</span><span>人</span><span>；交通补助限</span><span>往返</span><span><span>硬座、硬卧、高铁</span><span>/</span><span>动车二等座。）</span></span></p><p><span>八、注意事项</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span> <span>参加暑期学校的学生应严格遵守过程工程所相关安排，积极参加各项活动；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span> <span>申请者应保证申请时所提交的所有信息及纸版材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担。如发现有伪造排名证明材料、篡改成绩单、刻意提交不实信息等行为，过程工程所将直接取消申请人营员资格（如有）并向申请人所在学校汇报相应情况。</span></span></p><p><span><span>后续夏令营相关重要通知将在本网站和过程所微信公众号上发布，请关注我所信息！</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：赵老师、闫老师（过程所研招办</span>/<span>教育处）</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>010-82544960</span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span>yzb@ipe.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>QQ<span>群：</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>过程所招生</span></span><span>二</span><span><span>群</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>729331834</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：北京市海淀区中关村北二街</span>1<span>号，过程工程研究所</span></span></p><p><span><span>    欢迎关注</span><span>“</span><span>中国科学院过程工程所研究生教育</span><span>”</span><span>公众号！</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n<div>\n<p>附件下载：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</td>","textSha256":"6b71ceddda099297479e6b60730325a3edee04d0b225e67144f45d616e69e927","textLength":1988,"sourceSha256":"09909d0feaa18333120e0793165df8a6f47f2d5bca9c39ad5db5126794536033","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2c61785d9b7d409532fd","title":"2026年中国科学院过程工程研究所大学生暑期学校/夏令营开始报名啦","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:45.202613+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://edu.ipe.ac.cn/zsxx/202605/W020260512397920671884.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/9cfd7a2cb4f0b3e23abd.jpg"}]}
